  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c2bda163-94c9-578f-bc22-3a95c5a4842d",
    "name": "Vector Search API 🧠🧠🧠",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "- Endpoint: `GET /vector/v1/api.{json|xml|csv}` - semantic search across technologies and categories.\n- Example: `https://api.builtwith.com/vector/v1/api.json?KEY=YOUR_KEY&QUERY=react+framework`\n- Optional: `LIMIT` (default 10, max 100).\n- Credits: 1 per search.\n\nSample response:\n```json\n{\n  \"Query\": \"react framework\",\n  \"Results\": [\n    {\n      \"Type\": \"tech\",\n      \"Name\": \"React\",\n      \"Tag\": \"javascript\",\n      \"Score\": 0.9812,\n      \"Categories\": [\"JavaScript Library\", \"Framework\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"Errors\": []\n}\n```\n\nUpdated 2026-11-10 from https://api.builtwith.com/llms-full.txt. Set KEY locally. Requests are examples; sending data requests may consume credits. Optional query parameters are disabled until selected."
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Find Technologies by Meaning",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://api.builtwith.com/vector/v1/api.json?KEY={{KEY}}&QUERY=react%20framework&LIMIT=10",
          "protocol": "https",
          "host": [
            "api",
            "builtwith",
            "com"
          ],
          "path": [
            "vector",
            "v1",
            "api.json"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "KEY",
              "value": "{{KEY}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "QUERY",
              "value": "react framework"
            },
            {
              "key": "LIMIT",
              "value": "10"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
